" width="224.57"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.F2.p1.pic1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{M}=\left[\scalebox{0.7}{$\begin{matrix}~1~&amp;~0~&amp;~\cdots~&amp;~0~&amp;~1~\\
