<td id="A1.p1.1.1.46.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Set of reasoning paths and a single relational path.</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.p1.1.1.47" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.p1.1.1.47.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb"><math id="A1.m87" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{r}(\pi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{r}(\pi)</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.m88" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi_{\text{path}}(e)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>path</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi_{\text{path}}(e)</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.m89" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\omega(r)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega(r)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.p1.1.1.47.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">Path relevance score, path-based entity centrality, and relation depth penalty.</td></tr>
</table>
</span></div>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Algorithm and Complexity Analysis</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The pre-training, fine-tuning, and inference (QA task) pipeline of <span id="A2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Gfm</span>-Retriever is illustrated in Algorithm <a href="#algorithm1" title="In Appendix B Algorithm and Complexity Analysis ‣ Retrieving Minimal and Sufficient Reasoning Subgraphswith Graph Foundation Models for Path-aware GraphRAG" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, Algorithm <a href="#algorithm2" title="In B.1. Computational Complexity of the Pre-training Stage ‣ Appendix B Algorithm and Complexity Analysis ‣ Retrieving Minimal and Sufficient Reasoning Subgraphswith Graph Foundation Models for Path-aware GraphRAG" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, and Algorithm <a href="#algorithm3" title="In B.3. Computational Complexity of the Inference Stage (QA) ‣ Appendix B Algorithm and Complexity Analysis ‣ Retrieving Minimal and Sufficient Reasoning Subgraphswith Graph Foundation Models for Path-aware GraphRAG" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>. We next analyze their computational complexity.</p>
</div>
<figure id="algorithm1" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span>Pre-training of the GFM Retriever <math id="algorithm1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\bm{\theta}}(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>𝜽</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\bm{\theta}}(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm1.4.1" class="ltx_listingline">
<span id="algorithm1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span>
The multi-domain indexed KG <math id="algorithm1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{G}=(\mathcal{V},\mathcal{R},\mathcal{E})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{G}=(\mathcal{V},\mathcal{R},\mathcal{E})</annotation></semantics></math> over domains <math id="algorithm1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math>;
query-conditioned GFM <math id="algorithm1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\bm{\theta}}(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>𝜽</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\bm{\theta}}(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="algorithm1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math> layers;
hyper-parameters <math id="algorithm1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="algorithm1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="algorithm1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{3}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="algorithm1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>.
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.2.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> </span>Pre-trained GFM retriever <math id="algorithm1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\bm{\theta}}^{\star}(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>f</mi><mi>𝜽</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\bm{\theta}}^{\star}(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math>.
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">1</span></span>
          Initialize model parameters <math id="algorithm1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝜽</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.4" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">// </span><span id="algorithm1.4.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;"># Phase I: KG completion pre-training </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">2</span></span>
          <span id="algorithm1.4.5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for<span id="algorithm1.4.5.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <em id="algorithm1.4.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">each pre-training epoch</em> </span>do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.6" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
