</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.8" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">5</span></span>
          Initialize embeddings: <math id="algorithm1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{Z}_{e}^{(0)}\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐙</mi><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{Z}_{e}^{(0)}\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Eq. (<a href="#S4.E1" title="In 4.1. Generalized GFM as Cross-domain Retriever ‣ 4. Proposed Framework: Gfm-Retriever ‣ Retrieving Minimal and Sufficient Reasoning Subgraphswith Graph Foundation Models for Path-aware GraphRAG" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>);
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.9" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
