<p id="A5.I1.i11.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I1.i11.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">HippoRAG</span>: <a href="https://github.com/OSU-NLP-Group/HippoRAG" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/OSU-NLP-Group/HippoRAG</a>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I1.i12" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A5.I1.i12.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I1.i12.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I1.i12.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">HippoRAG</span> <span id="A5.I1.i12.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">2</span>: <a href="https://github.com/OSU-NLP-Group/HippoRAG" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/OSU-NLP-Group/HippoRAG</a>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I1.i13" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
