<p id="A5.I1.i13.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I1.i13.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">SubgraphRAG</span>: <a href="https://github.com/Graph-COM/SubgraphRAG" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/Graph-COM/SubgraphRAG</a>.</p>
</div></li>
